WEBVTT

00:00:16.190 --> 00:00:19.190
The showdown with
our enemy has begun!

00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:21.570
We're going to
attack them as well!

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:30.080
I'm going to finally destroy Blue 6!
I will! I WILL!

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:32.330
Now swear upon this sword!

00:00:32.410 --> 00:00:35.210
Swear that you will never
associate with the humans again!

00:00:36.040 --> 00:00:37.040
SWEAR IT!

00:00:39.340 --> 00:00:41.010
Why?

00:00:44.050 --> 00:00:45.840
WHY?

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:54.100
Think of what happened to AKAHAGE!
Of what those monsters did to him!

00:00:54.230 --> 00:00:56.900
Say that you'll help
avenge him! Swear it!

00:00:59.070 --> 00:01:00.230
SWEAR IT!

00:01:17.670 --> 00:01:19.290
YOU DAMNED TRAITOR!

00:01:21.550 --> 00:01:27.260
Banish her!

00:01:29.100 --> 00:01:31.430
BANISH HER!

00:01:52.370 --> 00:01:55.040
Sections A-6 and B-7,
taking on water! Seal them!

00:01:55.120 --> 00:01:58.420
- Switching to auxiliary pumps!
- Coolant water channel pressure dropping!

00:01:58.580 --> 00:02:01.290
Reactor auto-shutdown systems
are inoperative! Alert A!

00:02:01.420 --> 00:02:03.750
Shaft output now down to 30%!

00:02:03.840 --> 00:02:07.090
- We're going down!
- 1300 meters to ocean floor!

00:02:07.930 --> 00:02:11.220
Open all launch tubes!
Prep the nuclear warheads!

00:02:11.550 --> 00:02:13.260
We're not going
to die like this!

00:02:18.850 --> 00:02:19.730
Seal the partition! Hurry!

00:02:20.150 --> 00:02:22.940
Darling, protect me.

00:03:04.270 --> 00:03:05.690
Tetsu Hayami!

00:03:06.650 --> 00:03:10.320
For your arbitrary actions at Blue Dome
and repeated violations of orders...

00:03:10.410 --> 00:03:13.530
I'm ordering you off
of this vessel right now!

00:03:16.790 --> 00:03:19.540
Use the Grampus. It'll be faster.

00:03:20.870 --> 00:03:21.920
Commander.

00:03:22.710 --> 00:03:26.710
The only thing I can do now is
get us to the firing point on time...

00:03:26.800 --> 00:03:28.510
and then push
the launch button.

00:03:29.720 --> 00:03:32.510
Now try and outwit me
and this boat!

00:03:33.470 --> 00:03:35.300
Hurry! You don't have much time!

00:03:41.310 --> 00:03:45.400
I've checked out the navigation system
and the link with NOVO.

00:03:45.480 --> 00:03:47.070
The reserve fuel
tank's full, too.

00:03:47.900 --> 00:03:51.570
You could probably go all the way
to the Horrick range if you wanted to.

00:03:52.530 --> 00:03:53.280
Thanks.

00:03:53.740 --> 00:03:56.490
Oh? You're actually thanking
another person for something?

00:03:56.580 --> 00:03:57.780
I've never heard you do that!

00:03:58.490 --> 00:04:01.040
This is a one-way ticket.
Stand aside.

00:04:02.080 --> 00:04:05.000
No way.
This time I'm in front.

00:04:05.960 --> 00:04:08.250
- I'm going with you.
- You'll die.

00:04:09.090 --> 00:04:10.050
I've already made up my mind.

00:04:10.760 --> 00:04:14.890
I hate having that bad taste
left in my mouth. Besides...

00:04:14.970 --> 00:04:16.800
Besides, I've come this far.

00:04:17.560 --> 00:04:21.680
I wanna meet that Zorndyke guy
once and punch him out!

00:04:23.690 --> 00:04:25.940
Ha... yami!

00:04:28.980 --> 00:04:31.940
Flood the dock! Hurry! Kino!

00:04:34.280 --> 00:04:36.110
What are you doing?
Lieutenant Kino!

00:04:36.490 --> 00:04:39.160
You don't have launch
clearance! Abort! Kino...

00:04:40.950 --> 00:04:43.120
Watertight seal confirmed.

00:04:53.550 --> 00:04:55.220
Incoming! Six torpedoes!
Correction! Eight!

00:04:55.680 --> 00:05:00.890
Set tubes 4 and 7 to deploy homeguards
at a range of 3000, time intervals of 2!

00:05:11.320 --> 00:05:11.980
No good!

00:05:12.320 --> 00:05:14.440
Two torpedoes,
on collision course!

00:05:22.330 --> 00:05:23.660
It's Mr. Hayami!

00:05:27.420 --> 00:05:28.830
Get going, you idiot!

00:05:38.800 --> 00:05:42.140
Incoming! From dead above
and dead below!

00:05:43.470 --> 00:05:44.430
A pincer move?

00:05:45.350 --> 00:05:48.150
Blow front tanks!
90 degrees up trim!

00:05:48.230 --> 00:05:49.690
Set for simultaneous
front and rear launch!

00:05:49.770 --> 00:05:50.900
Ping and fire!

00:06:01.240 --> 00:06:02.780
Two Musucas have broken
through our defense line!

00:06:03.200 --> 00:06:05.290
They're headed right
for Sub Zero behind us!

00:06:05.710 --> 00:06:08.790
Maintain trim and blow rear tanks!
Flood front tanks!

00:06:08.880 --> 00:06:11.040
Forward tubes 2 and 4, FIRE!

00:06:19.220 --> 00:06:20.890
Eat your heart out,
Ringling Brothers!

00:06:21.300 --> 00:06:24.890
Wanna have a little show after
this battle? You and me together?

00:06:25.020 --> 00:06:27.230
Kumos, dead ahead!

00:06:37.030 --> 00:06:40.490
- 5 Kumos ahead at 220!
- Breaking through!

00:06:47.460 --> 00:06:49.250
Two of them left. Torpedoes?

00:06:49.330 --> 00:06:50.750
- Fly!
- Huh?

00:06:54.920 --> 00:06:57.260
- "Fly?"
- Don't let go of the helm!

00:07:15.980 --> 00:07:18.110
- Second wave, approaching!
- Deploy homeguards!

00:07:18.190 --> 00:07:21.450
- Tubes 1, 2, and 3, flooded!
- Tubes 4, 5, and 6, flooded!

00:07:21.660 --> 00:07:23.200
Set range at 2000 and fire!

00:07:29.250 --> 00:07:30.620
7 torpedoes remaining!

00:07:31.040 --> 00:07:33.670
Subs 8 and 7 are deploying
their Grampuses!

00:07:39.470 --> 00:07:40.470
No! Don't go forward!

00:07:47.430 --> 00:07:49.930
- Close-range launches! Multiple Musucas!
- Can you see their shadows?

00:07:50.350 --> 00:07:52.100
Can't! They've got barriers!

00:07:52.190 --> 00:07:53.940
Bottom deck taking on water,
but not critical!

00:07:54.150 --> 00:07:56.940
Load all tubes with enzyme warheads!
Full-circle search!

00:08:01.200 --> 00:08:03.950
12... 16... We're surrounded!

00:08:04.370 --> 00:08:07.450
<i>- Range: 1500!</i>
- All tubes, FIRE!

00:08:07.700 --> 00:08:09.370
Water temperature
is rising radically.

00:08:09.910 --> 00:08:12.870
- Are we close?
- Yeah, assuming NOVO's correct.

00:08:13.420 --> 00:08:16.460
That other time,
we never got to the other end.

00:08:22.050 --> 00:08:24.840
Incredible. What an upheaval!

00:08:31.430 --> 00:08:34.480
- We're surrounded!
- Wait! Don't shoot!

00:08:36.400 --> 00:08:38.730
Why? Why aren't they attacking?

00:08:39.860 --> 00:08:40.690
I don't know.

00:08:46.620 --> 00:08:48.950
<i>See you around, Hayami.</i>

00:08:56.250 --> 00:08:57.500
Message from Sub 7!

00:08:57.710 --> 00:09:00.550
"Using remaining buoyancy to get
to the surface. The rest is up to you."

00:09:10.310 --> 00:09:11.850
Remaining Musucas are approaching.

00:09:12.600 --> 00:09:14.180
Entering firing range
of their sonic cannons!

00:09:14.310 --> 00:09:15.890
Iceberg, directly above us!

00:09:16.060 --> 00:09:18.650
Blow main tanks!
Take us up to 80 meters!

00:09:19.820 --> 00:09:21.530
Hide us along the iceberg's surface!

00:09:32.580 --> 00:09:33.910
Captain! Sub Zero is...!

00:09:34.250 --> 00:09:38.500
Out of control. Out of control.
Rising to surface.

00:09:39.250 --> 00:09:40.920
Hide us inside the ice ridges!

00:09:41.630 --> 00:09:42.670
That's too dangerous, sir!

00:09:43.670 --> 00:09:45.670
We have no choice.
It'll buy us some time.

00:09:46.260 --> 00:09:48.180
NOVO! Surface Sub Zero!

00:09:57.400 --> 00:10:01.310
So... This is Antarctica, huh?

00:10:05.110 --> 00:10:06.570
Looks that way.

00:10:10.990 --> 00:10:12.450
- Hey...
- Shh!

00:10:25.550 --> 00:10:31.010
" 'Today, today!' Each day
I have waited for you..."

00:10:31.140 --> 00:10:35.810
"and now do they not say you are
strewn with the shells of Ishi River?"

00:10:35.930 --> 00:10:43.480
"Love is simply a sad lament I sing to
the clouds as they pass the Ishi River..."

00:11:08.800 --> 00:11:09.670
Look!

00:11:37.160 --> 00:11:40.210
- Engines stopped!
- Orbital calculations?

00:11:40.710 --> 00:11:43.330
- No problems.
- And the Musucas?

00:11:43.420 --> 00:11:45.420
It's strange.
I can't hear them anymore.

00:11:48.840 --> 00:11:52.510
All right, we'll fire from here.
They'll be back soon.

00:11:52.840 --> 00:11:58.390
When they do, we'll use ourselves as
a decoy and defend Sub Zero to the death.

00:11:59.100 --> 00:12:02.730
All right. We'll stay with you.
We'll give 'em a fight to remember!

00:12:03.230 --> 00:12:07.230
I'm ready for more.
It's fine with me.

00:12:08.190 --> 00:12:11.780
Activating launch sequence.
Starting countdown.

00:12:12.780 --> 00:12:14.320
I'm counting on you, NOVO.

00:12:14.410 --> 00:12:16.910
I just control the operation
of the system.

00:12:16.990 --> 00:12:19.950
Deciding to use it is
the job of you humans.

00:12:42.850 --> 00:12:44.890
Nuclear torpedoes, ready to fire!

00:12:46.020 --> 00:12:52.360
Excellent! Contact the Musucas!
Tell them I'LL be finishing off Blue 6!

00:13:19.050 --> 00:13:21.140
- Calm down.
- Same to you!

00:13:42.830 --> 00:13:48.500
Ah. Such young visitors.

00:13:50.750 --> 00:13:56.090
This is a very savage land.
The end of the world, in fact.

00:13:57.890 --> 00:13:59.550
What can I do for you?

00:14:01.510 --> 00:14:05.100
Why? Why are you
destroying the world?

00:14:07.020 --> 00:14:09.350
You still live.

00:14:10.310 --> 00:14:12.190
The world will not be destroyed.

00:14:13.190 --> 00:14:15.610
As long as you wish it.

00:14:16.280 --> 00:14:17.360
Don't insult us!

00:14:17.860 --> 00:14:21.200
Are we supposed to live as slaves
of these monsters you created?

00:14:42.640 --> 00:14:44.390
Sub 8, destroyed!

00:14:44.770 --> 00:14:46.060
What's the Phantom Ship's position?

00:14:46.140 --> 00:14:47.890
17 degrees to starboard,
range: 4800!

00:14:48.140 --> 00:14:50.060
It's right in the center
of the encircling forces!

00:14:50.190 --> 00:14:52.900
- Incoming! 3 torpedoes!
- Sound trackers, FIRE!

00:14:58.450 --> 00:15:01.320
Fuel onload,
five minutes to completion.

00:15:01.410 --> 00:15:04.870
Launch in 37 minutes 55.03 seconds.

00:15:05.790 --> 00:15:07.330
Take us straight
into the middle of them.

00:15:07.410 --> 00:15:09.080
We're going to break their back!

00:15:09.210 --> 00:15:10.080
Captain?

00:15:10.210 --> 00:15:12.880
Load all tubes!
Prep for continuous fire!

00:15:14.590 --> 00:15:16.590
Don't let us down, "Slow Turtle."

00:15:21.140 --> 00:15:25.260
One day, I was left all alone.

00:15:26.770 --> 00:15:32.650
Suddenly, everything I was working
on just didn't matter anymore.

00:15:32.770 --> 00:15:35.230
My heart went out of it.

00:15:38.150 --> 00:15:43.030
Project Blue. Wheat that
would grow at the poles.

00:15:43.120 --> 00:15:45.410
Potatoes that would thrive
in the desert.

00:15:45.490 --> 00:15:48.290
The utilization of artificial
protein under the sea.

00:15:49.370 --> 00:15:52.000
Useless. All of it, useless.

00:15:53.130 --> 00:15:56.130
Even doing that wouldn't
change us in any way.

00:15:57.210 --> 00:16:03.720
Rather... It would only increase
our arrogance, wouldn't it?

00:16:08.770 --> 00:16:12.100
That isn't an answer, Zorndyke!

00:16:15.610 --> 00:16:20.530
I... I simply said
"NO" to this world.

00:16:22.320 --> 00:16:27.410
And then I gave birth to
my new, wonderful children.

00:16:28.200 --> 00:16:31.870
I flooded the major cities and
the chief grain-producing areas.

00:16:32.670 --> 00:16:36.830
I thought it could end just by sharply
reducing the number of humans alive.

00:16:37.670 --> 00:16:42.550
I thought so!
You ARE the cause of all of this!

00:16:43.550 --> 00:16:44.930
Why is it?

00:16:46.430 --> 00:16:47.510
Why?

00:16:49.720 --> 00:16:53.020
Why didn't you think
you could live with them?

00:16:53.810 --> 00:16:56.060
They attacked us first!

00:16:56.400 --> 00:16:57.110
Oh?

00:16:57.480 --> 00:17:00.530
- It was them. They struck first!
- Wait.

00:17:02.150 --> 00:17:03.360
Zorndyke.

00:17:05.860 --> 00:17:07.120
Have you...

00:17:11.950 --> 00:17:15.420
Has all of this been
a test for us?

00:17:26.970 --> 00:17:29.050
Where are they?
Where's Blue 6?

00:17:29.890 --> 00:17:33.600
I... I don't know!
I can only hear noise!

00:17:34.520 --> 00:17:36.060
Have the Musucas pull back!

00:17:37.100 --> 00:17:38.600
Are we gonna use 'em?

00:17:38.810 --> 00:17:43.820
Yes! Load the nuclear torpedoes!
Use the boosters, too!

00:17:44.240 --> 00:17:46.200
We'll destroy them
all in one blow!

00:17:52.540 --> 00:17:54.040
Cavitation!

00:17:54.160 --> 00:17:57.920
Bearing to 2 o'clock, depth 120!
It's moving along the ocean floor!

00:17:58.000 --> 00:17:59.040
Hm? Heh.

00:18:03.090 --> 00:18:06.420
They are my children.

00:18:08.090 --> 00:18:10.800
Like you, they are
inexperienced life-forms.

00:18:11.640 --> 00:18:13.560
But you can learn
from each other.

00:18:13.640 --> 00:18:17.940
Learn to respect,
even understand each other as equals.

00:18:19.150 --> 00:18:22.070
Just as every other
living thing in this world.

00:18:22.190 --> 00:18:24.570
That's not what I wanted
to hear from you!

00:18:25.110 --> 00:18:28.200
My father. My mother.
My big sister...!

00:18:29.870 --> 00:18:31.780
Why did you kill them?

00:18:33.830 --> 00:18:36.620
Do you hate me?

00:18:41.000 --> 00:18:41.830
Kino!

00:18:46.920 --> 00:18:47.800
I hate you!

00:18:49.590 --> 00:18:53.600
All the same. Nothing's changed.

00:18:55.810 --> 00:18:58.100
If nothing is done,
nothing will ever change.

00:18:58.190 --> 00:19:00.810
Wh- What are you talking about?

00:19:02.060 --> 00:19:04.820
If you shoot me,
will it go away?

00:19:06.990 --> 00:19:11.030
If you shoot me, will it go away?
That hatred you carry?

00:19:16.410 --> 00:19:17.330
Maybe it will.

00:19:18.710 --> 00:19:20.040
I, too...

00:19:20.790 --> 00:19:24.340
I, too, once felt the feelings
that you carry now.

00:19:26.170 --> 00:19:32.550
I, too, asked "why?" to things
whose true forms were invisible.

00:19:34.510 --> 00:19:39.270
But, in the end, all I was left
with was nothingness and disgust.

00:19:40.850 --> 00:19:42.810
I was just like
the rest of them.

00:19:44.520 --> 00:19:46.320
And to that disgust we
all carry, I simply say...

00:19:48.400 --> 00:19:49.690
"NO."

00:19:57.910 --> 00:20:02.250
Verg, they're suffering!
Suffering their guts out!

00:20:08.960 --> 00:20:12.050
- Burn them! Burn them all!
- Verg!

00:20:12.130 --> 00:20:17.180
That's not them!
It's not Blue 6's screw!

00:20:23.020 --> 00:20:23.940
C'mon!

00:20:32.240 --> 00:20:33.360
GO TO HELL!

00:20:46.590 --> 00:20:50.760
Stop this! Stop this all right now!
Stop melting the glaciers!

00:20:50.880 --> 00:20:53.380
Stop the pole shift!
Stop making your monsters, too!

00:20:55.590 --> 00:20:57.430
- I cannot.
- Why?

00:21:00.060 --> 00:21:01.850
I don't have that power.

00:21:04.390 --> 00:21:07.980
This has all grown and enmeshed
itself beyond my control.

00:21:09.440 --> 00:21:11.940
All I can do now is watch.

00:21:13.990 --> 00:21:15.570
Look at this enormous hole here.

00:21:16.910 --> 00:21:19.490
The shaft goes deep
through the Earth's crust.

00:21:20.160 --> 00:21:22.790
Right down into
the mantle layer.

00:21:23.790 --> 00:21:26.420
The entire magnetic
power system continues...

00:21:27.000 --> 00:21:32.170
to operate with my heartbeat
as its password.

00:21:39.260 --> 00:21:41.010
But I didn't have enough time.

00:21:42.270 --> 00:21:48.480
I don't have enough energy
to trigger the pole shift.

00:21:48.900 --> 00:21:49.980
What?

00:21:51.070 --> 00:21:52.230
It is a gamble.

00:21:52.990 --> 00:21:57.570
I predicted that your final trump to play
would be the use of nuclear weapons.

00:21:59.320 --> 00:22:00.490
You're saying...?

00:22:00.870 --> 00:22:05.830
Go on and burn this promised land
to ashes, if you wish.

00:22:07.830 --> 00:22:13.050
The moment you do, the lid to hell will
be opened, and the pole shift will begin.

00:22:22.890 --> 00:22:25.100
T-minus 10 minutes and counting.

00:22:25.180 --> 00:22:28.560
- Mmm. What about the Musucas?
- No sign of them.

00:22:29.020 --> 00:22:30.810
Everyone... Everyone's running away.

00:22:31.860 --> 00:22:33.020
They're scared.

00:22:51.210 --> 00:22:52.790
XO, get ready!

00:22:52.880 --> 00:22:55.590
Captain! Kino and Hayami
aren't back yet!

00:22:58.260 --> 00:22:59.090
I have no choice.

00:23:01.260 --> 00:23:02.090
Wait!

00:23:03.310 --> 00:23:08.600
Wait, please. It's just...

00:23:09.060 --> 00:23:11.190
Yamada! Take her to her room!

00:23:11.270 --> 00:23:12.560
Don't fire!

00:23:13.650 --> 00:23:16.730
That's what Mr. Nonaka told me.

00:23:17.490 --> 00:23:19.650
He said to trust Mr. Hayami.

00:23:21.620 --> 00:23:27.370
You... You talk like that.
You monster!

00:23:28.870 --> 00:23:30.710
Then burn this place.

00:23:32.380 --> 00:23:34.590
If you hate me, then shoot.

00:23:35.920 --> 00:23:37.670
But the seed has been planted.

00:23:38.880 --> 00:23:43.890
The world will change.
You can't stop it now.

00:23:45.970 --> 00:23:48.220
What happens next depends on you.

00:23:48.310 --> 00:23:51.390
Is that the rule
you've fated for us?

00:23:51.940 --> 00:23:54.610
In this game what you gamble
with human lives?

00:23:55.400 --> 00:24:02.450
My wife. My son and his... My granddaughter
along with countless others...

00:24:04.700 --> 00:24:07.370
I found them in that hole
in the forest.

00:24:08.290 --> 00:24:10.870
And so now you think
you're God?

00:24:11.290 --> 00:24:16.130
In that moment,
my entire world collapsed.

00:24:16.750 --> 00:24:18.210
Zorndyke!

00:24:18.920 --> 00:24:23.720
Your world...
I do not accept this world.

00:24:24.140 --> 00:24:26.800
To it, I shall always say... "NO."

00:24:31.850 --> 00:24:34.100
That isn't your job.

00:24:35.230 --> 00:24:38.480
Contact Blue 6.
Tell them not to launch.

00:24:39.480 --> 00:24:43.360
Why? Why?

00:24:53.750 --> 00:24:58.000
The world will not be destroyed.
It will merely change.

00:25:00.960 --> 00:25:03.340
So long as you wish it to.

00:25:22.320 --> 00:25:25.570
Tell this to the nations
of the Blue.

00:25:26.530 --> 00:25:33.370
"That the poles and this sea
are holy to my children."

00:25:37.710 --> 00:25:39.540
Is there any reason to fear?

00:25:41.550 --> 00:25:44.220
They'll understand you.

00:25:49.300 --> 00:25:50.140
I know.

00:25:57.060 --> 00:25:59.810
The day the uprising began,

00:26:01.320 --> 00:26:09.410
I have been dead,
ever since that day.

00:26:11.950 --> 00:26:13.580
Message from Lieutenant Kino!

00:26:15.120 --> 00:26:17.870
"Mass destruction system is disabled!
Request pick-up! "

00:26:18.330 --> 00:26:20.080
She did it!

00:26:23.340 --> 00:26:24.340
Thank you, Lord.

00:26:24.760 --> 00:26:27.090
- Yuri, the abort code.
- Aye, sir!

00:26:27.260 --> 00:26:29.430
Let's pick up the survivors
on the surface.

00:26:29.510 --> 00:26:31.720
- Prepare to deploy the search probe.
- Aye, sir!

00:26:31.810 --> 00:26:34.470
Captain! Should I get
the cutter ready?

00:26:34.640 --> 00:26:37.600
- Yeah. Go get them.
- Aye, sir!

00:26:49.780 --> 00:26:51.820
You did it, Hayami.

00:26:52.280 --> 00:26:54.740
<i>What are the enemy</i>
<i>ships doing?</i>

00:26:55.000 --> 00:27:01.830
Far... Far below us.
In the dark place.

00:27:03.960 --> 00:27:05.340
They're crying.

00:27:07.090 --> 00:27:09.010
Right. Right.

00:27:11.850 --> 00:27:14.350
I'll contact you when he
gets here. Over and out.

00:28:34.840 --> 00:28:38.260
PAPA! PAPA!

00:28:46.230 --> 00:28:49.940
Why? WHY?

00:28:51.240 --> 00:28:57.530
You said you'd teach me new words
when I got back, didn't you?

00:28:57.620 --> 00:29:01.750
Please, say something!
Speak to me!

00:29:27.020 --> 00:29:28.810
Hu... man.

00:29:29.820 --> 00:29:31.360
A human!

00:29:31.530 --> 00:29:34.780
You killed him.
YOU KILLED HIM!

00:29:35.280 --> 00:29:38.410
With those filthy hands of yours!

00:29:39.530 --> 00:29:40.370
Hayami!

00:30:01.310 --> 00:30:02.720
I'll kill you!

00:30:04.310 --> 00:30:05.350
Do it.

00:30:08.520 --> 00:30:13.230
But Zorndyke said
we should talk first.

00:30:15.990 --> 00:30:17.070
F- First...

00:30:19.370 --> 00:30:20.660
we have to talk together!

00:30:20.830 --> 00:30:24.500
Don't you dare
even SAY Papa's name!

00:30:24.750 --> 00:30:25.660
Stop it!

00:30:26.660 --> 00:30:27.870
Stay back, you idiot!

00:30:35.420 --> 00:30:36.550
That's what...

00:30:39.340 --> 00:30:40.800
What your papa told me.

00:30:42.180 --> 00:30:43.260
It's not true!

00:30:43.970 --> 00:30:45.100
We can...

00:30:45.770 --> 00:30:46.930
It's not true!

00:30:47.600 --> 00:30:49.940
understand each other...

00:30:51.060 --> 00:30:52.980
It's not true! It's not true!

00:30:53.570 --> 00:30:54.860
as equals.

00:30:56.190 --> 00:30:59.700
He was...
Papa was tricked by you!

00:30:59.860 --> 00:31:05.160
So much. So much!
He always looked so sad.

00:31:06.450 --> 00:31:09.330
It was your fault. Your fault!

00:31:09.870 --> 00:31:16.170
Your lies. Your tricks.
Your killing! Your stealing!

00:31:16.880 --> 00:31:19.880
You all... You all!

00:31:35.070 --> 00:31:37.400
Stop! Stop it!

00:31:42.570 --> 00:31:45.080
Let go! Let him go!

00:31:46.540 --> 00:31:48.160
I said let him go!

00:31:48.250 --> 00:31:51.210
Let him go!
Let him go! Let him go!

00:31:51.580 --> 00:31:54.750
Stop it! STOP IT!

00:32:01.800 --> 00:32:05.220
Hayami! Speak to me!
Are you okay?

00:32:08.680 --> 00:32:10.020
Zorndyke...

00:32:15.730 --> 00:32:18.280
said it was up to us...

00:32:20.360 --> 00:32:22.320
to change the future.

00:33:02.820 --> 00:33:04.150
Salt water.

00:33:12.080 --> 00:33:14.120
I don't WANT to talk to you!

00:33:41.650 --> 00:33:44.740
Hayami! Hayami! Ha...ya...!

00:34:46.420 --> 00:34:48.510
Ha... ya... mi.

00:35:54.200 --> 00:35:57.990
East Sepik. Irian Jaya...

00:35:59.660 --> 00:36:02.000
I've killed so many people.

00:36:04.420 --> 00:36:08.340
But... But this was
the first time...

00:36:10.680 --> 00:36:15.140
when I did it in the light
and face to face.

00:36:47.000 --> 00:36:52.800
"Not knowing I am pillowed among
the crags on Kamo Mountain..."

00:36:52.880 --> 00:36:56.720
"my wife must still be
waiting for my return."

00:36:58.140 --> 00:37:03.520
" 'Today, today!' Each day
I have waited for you..."

00:37:04.270 --> 00:37:08.190
"and now do they not say you are
strewn with the shells of Ishi River?"

00:37:26.230 --> 00:37:30.790
<i>Ne ikenai anata ni fureta
Tell me, is it wrong? I want to touch you.</i>

00:37:30.790 --> 00:37:33.680
<i>Kasanaru yori fukai
Deeper and deeper into you.</i>

00:37:33.680 --> 00:37:35.570
<i>Sweet whisper...</i>

00:37:35.570 --> 00:37:40.190
<i>Modokashi ore
I want to vanish...</i>

00:37:40.190 --> 00:37:43.370
<i>Takata ni kieta
...into the foam in the tantalizing orange light...</i>

00:37:43.370 --> 00:37:46.940
<i>Tsuki e no michi wo
Will the moonlight path on the waves...</i>

00:37:46.940 --> 00:37:51.990
<i>Anata e to tsuzuku kashira
...lead me to you, I wonder...</i>

00:37:51.990 --> 00:37:56.500
<i>Wasurerarenai atsui manazashi
I can't forget that warm gaze...</i>

00:37:56.500 --> 00:38:00.980
<i>Soshite amai toiki
...and that sweet sigh.</i>

00:38:05.370 --> 00:38:09.010
<i>Susarei de lullaby
That whispered lullaby...</i>

00:38:14.380 --> 00:38:18.390
<i>Eien lullaby
That eternal lullaby...</i>

00:38:18.920 --> 00:38:23.280
<i>Come whisper to me and touch me...</i>

00:38:23.280 --> 00:38:27.760
<i>Tokimeki wa ren'ai kotoba wa ren'ai
I'm dizzy from my beating heart, don't need any words now.</i>

00:38:27.760 --> 00:38:30.950
<i>Whisper love...</i>

00:38:47.900 --> 00:38:56.750
<i>Setsunaku ayamii anata no toiki ni
Your dangerous sigh that almost breaks my heart...</i>

00:38:57.180 --> 00:38:59.940
<i>Just whisper...</i>

00:39:00.500 --> 00:39:04.410
<i>...and love sweet touch.</i>

00:39:14.730 --> 00:39:23.710
<i>Setsunaku ayamii anata no toiki ni
Your dangerous sigh that almost breaks my heart...</i>

00:39:23.710 --> 00:39:27.750
<i>Sweet whisper... dakaredai
Sweet whisper... I want to embrace you...</i>

00:39:27.750 --> 00:39:30.000
<i>...and love sweet touch.</i>

00:39:30.430 --> 00:39:32.490
<i>Mitaretai
I want to go mad...</i>

00:39:32.660 --> 00:39:41.510
<i>Setsunaku ayamii anata no toiki ni
Your dangerous sigh that almost breaks my heart...</i>

00:39:41.850 --> 00:39:45.570
<i>Sweet whisper... Mitaretai
Sweet whisper... I want to go mad...</i>

00:39:45.570 --> 00:39:48.350
<i>...and love sweet touch.</i>

00:39:48.350 --> 00:39:50.650
<i>Kutsuretai
I want to crumble away...</i>

00:39:50.650 --> 00:39:55.070
<i>Agareru omoe wa
These burning feelings...</i>

00:39:55.070 --> 00:39:59.520
<i>Mina soko ni nemure
...are sleeping deep inside of everyone.</i>

00:40:00.050 --> 00:40:04.790
<i>Yume tsumeru made
Until we awaken from this dream...</i>

00:40:05.270 --> 00:40:07.190
<i>Sweet whisper...</i>

00:40:08.210 --> 00:40:15.610
<i>Mina soko ni nemure...
Sleeping deep inside everyone...</i>
